  "description": "As the last of the divine beasts who protected the land, Lionel Milliard was coveted by women for his power and influence. But after an accident with an ancient relic binds him to an inn worker named Hanna, he finally finds one woman with no interest in him! Lionel, intrigued by Hanna's rejection, convinces her to go on a journey with him to free them of the relic's power. Hanna reluctantly agrees, but will she be able to fend off Lionel's advances, or will this beast devour yet another woman? \n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes 11 extra chapters.*",
